        "created_at": "2014-02-17T14:47:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<blockquote><p><strong>From the quiz game thread</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><div><p><b>Christopher wrote:</b></p><blockquote><blockquote><p>Citizen Dawn only has her citizens and Legacy</p></blockquote><p>In Citizen Dawn's deck, I see Legacy, Fanatic, The Wraith, and The Visionary.And several bats, but those don't count.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></blockquote></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Oh Dear! OH DEAR</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Blinding Blast -&nbsp;Wraith and&nbsp;<strong>Tempest&nbsp;</strong>(though the flavor text says visionary...)</p><p>It could be Fanatic in sillhoutte on Devestating Aurora?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I hate it when he does that :p</p><p>&nbsp;</p></blockquote><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Okay. I see Legacy obviously. Wraith is obviously on Blinding Blast, thou that looks more like Tempest, but if the boss says its Visionary...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Where is Fanatic?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:40:23.443Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
