        "raw": "<blockquote><p><strong>From the quiz game thread</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"bb-quote\" style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><p><b>Christopher wrote:</b></p><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\" style=\"border-color: rgb(153, 153, 153); margin-right: 15px; background-image: url(https://greaterthangames.com/sites/all/themes/greaterthangamestheme/images/icon-quote.png);\"><blockquote style=\"border-color: rgb(153, 153, 153); background-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); margin-right: 15px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 10px; margin-left: 0px;\">Citizen Dawn only has her citizens and Legacy</p></blockquote><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px;\">In Citizen Dawn&#39;s deck, I see Legacy, Fanatic, The Wraith, and The Visionary.And several bats, but those don&#39;t count.</p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 10px; margin-left: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p></blockquote></div><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Oh Dear! OH DEAR</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Blinding Blast -&nbsp;Wraith and&nbsp;<strong>Tempest&nbsp;</strong>(though the flavor text says visionary...)</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">It could be Fanatic in sillhoutte on Devestating Aurora?</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">I hate it when he does that :p</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</p></blockquote><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Okay. I see Legacy obviously. Wraith is obviously on Blinding Blast, thou that looks more like Tempest, but if the boss says its Visionary...</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Where is Fanatic?</p>",
